<p>The client will only need to appear at the hotel with the confirmation code and identify himself with his passport (if he is a foreigner) or with his national identity document (if he is a Peruvian). In case of breakfast or other food is included in the offered hotel rate, this will be clearly specified. The client must comply with the hours established for the consumption of these meals according to the hotel's policy. Any extra consumption not clearly specified as included will have to be paid directly by the client and will be solely their responsibility.</p>

